show "=== Session contract: template ==="

remember a source called primary-source with "paste the verbatim source text here"
remember a claim called working-claim with "paste the claim text being verified here"

remember a string called source-state with "unscanned"
remember a string called claim-basis with "none"
remember a list called tracked-decisions with "none"
remember a list called open-questions with "none"
remember a number called decision-count with 0

remember how to disclose from status: show status
remember how to summarize from label: count label

when source-state is equal to "unscanned"
  show "HOLD: source not yet scanned — verify before consequential claims"

when claim-basis is equal to "inference" unless source-state is equal to "verified"
  show "WARNING: current claims are inferred, not verified against source"

when claim-basis is equal to "verified"
  show "OK: claims grounded in verified source"

show "--- state snapshot ---"
show source-state
show claim-basis
show tracked-decisions
show open-questions

show "--- example: citing the source before a consequential claim ---"
cite "paste" from primary-source

show "--- example: accumulating decisions and questions ---"
add "decision-architecture-three-layer" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-vocab-bounded-35" to tracked-decisions
add "question-pack-loader-design" to open-questions
show tracked-decisions
show open-questions
summarize from tracked-decisions

show "--- example: routing on verification status ---"
choose if source-state is equal to "verified": show "proceed with claims" otherwise show "hold or disclose"

disclose from claim-basis

remember a source called kestrel-spec with "Version: 0.4.2\nBase URL: https://api.kestrel.internal/v0\nAuth: bearer JWT, RS256, 15-minute expiry, refresh via /auth/refresh.\nRate limits: 240 requests/minute per project token (burst 30/sec). Hard ceiling at 5,000 requests/hour. Returns 429 with Retry-After header (seconds).\nPayload schema: 17 top-level fields. Required: id (UUID v7), tenant_id, created_at (RFC 3339), event_type. Optional: 13 others. Maximum payload size: 256 KiB.\nIdempotency: clients SHOULD send Idempotency-Key header (UUID v4). Server retains keys for 24h.\nWebhooks: outbound POSTs sign HMAC-SHA256 with X-Kestrel-Signature; signing secret rotates every 90 days.\nDecided 2026-04-12 by the platform team: ship v0 with these limits; revisit rate caps after first 500 customers onboard."

remember a string called source-state with "verified"
remember a string called claim-basis with "verified"
remember a list called tracked-decisions with "none"
remember a list called open-questions with "none"
remember a number called decision-count with 0

remember how to disclose from status: show status
remember how to summarize from label: count label

when source-state is equal to "unscanned"
  show "HOLD: source not yet scanned — verify before consequential claims"

when claim-basis is equal to "inference" unless source-state is equal to "verified"
  show "WARNING: current claims are inferred, not verified against source"

when claim-basis is equal to "verified"
  show "OK: claims grounded in verified source"

cite "240 requests/minute per project token" from kestrel-spec
cite "id (UUID v7), tenant_id, created_at (RFC 3339), event_type" from kestrel-spec
cite "Idempotency-Key header (UUID v4). Server retains keys for 24h" from kestrel-spec
cite "HMAC-SHA256 with X-Kestrel-Signature; signing secret rotates every 90 days" from kestrel-spec
cite "revisit rate caps after first 500 customers onboard" from kestrel-spec

add "kestrel-spec-v0.4.2-captured" to tracked-decisions

cite "240 requests/minute per project token (burst 30/sec)" from kestrel-spec
cite "5,000 requests/hour" from kestrel-spec
cite "Retry-After header (seconds)" from kestrel-spec
cite "Idempotency-Key header (UUID v4). Server retains keys for 24h" from kestrel-spec

add "retry-layer-honor-retry-after-header-over-fixed-backoff" to tracked-decisions
add "retry-layer-exponential-backoff-jitter-for-5xx-only" to tracked-decisions
add "retry-layer-client-side-token-bucket-per-project-token" to tracked-decisions
add "retry-layer-reuse-idempotency-key-on-retry" to tracked-decisions
add "retry-layer-shared-counter-for-multi-instance-deployments" to tracked-decisions